      "source": "# 1. Creating different data structures for students\n\nstudents_list = [\"YABI\", \"ADI\", \"AAYUSH\"]\n\nstudents_tuple = (\"YABI\", \"ADI\", \"AAYUSH\")\n\nstudents_dict = {\n    101: \"YABI\",\n    102: \"ADI\",\n    103: \"AAYUSH\"\n}\n\nprint(\"--- Initial Data Structures\")\nprint(f\"List:       {students_list}\")\nprint(f\"Tuple:      {students_tuple}\")\nprint(f\"Dictionary: {students_dict}\\n\")\n\n\n# 2. Performing Dictionary Operations\n\n# --- OPERATION 1: ADD ---\nstudents_dict[104] = \"David\"\nprint(\"--- After Adding Roll 104 (David) ---\")\nprint(f\"Dictionary: {students_dict}\\n\")\n\n\n# --- OPERATION 2: UPDATE ---\nstudents_dict[102] = \"Robert\"\nprint(\"--- After Updating Roll 102 to 'Robert' ---\")\nprint(f\"Dictionary: {students_dict}\\n\")\n\n\n# --- OPERATION 3: DELETE ---\nif 103 in students_dict:\n    del students_dict[103]\nprint(\"--- After Deleting Roll 103 ---\")\nprint(f\"Dictionary: {students_dict}\\n\")\n\n\n# Final State summary\nprint(\"--- Final State of All Structures ---\")\nprint(f\"List (Unchanged):       {students_list}\")\nprint(f\"Tuple (Immutable):      {students_tuple}\")\nprint(f\"Dictionary (Modified):  {students_dict}\")\n",
